; Which characters bean-format accepts in an account (spec/beancount/format.md): each one is
; second in a component (Assets:Lx) or first in a later one (Assets:L:xB).
; The Equity account is the widest: an aligned posting's number moves right, a kept one stays 5 spaces away.
; ledgermill's parser does not read these accounts yet; bean-check accepts them.
option "operating_currency" "EUR"

2026-01-01 open Equity:Anchor:AVeryLongAccountName
